          </element>
          <element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="B-D07 Business Event Diagram" id="id-4cb7133e8d724cdaa76bc944017abeb6">
            <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-a114f2b1a8f1438a97d63c640ec9c6d9" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#FFFFFF">
              <bounds x="24" y="24" width="620" height="430"/>
              <content>Business Event Diagram
TOGAF artifact - Phase B - Business Architecture

PURPOSE
Shows the relationship between business events and the processes they trigger or result from.

